// Inside a type the nesting limit refused, a name is used only where a type
// position names it. A callable type's parameter name, a member written
// after a dot and a function written where a type is are not uses of the
// declarations that share their names, so those are still [N-Unused].
struct Box[T] {
    item: T,
}

